                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p><b><i>supplementary housing agreement</i></b> means an agreement that:</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-a-3">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>is entered into between the Commonwealth and a single State; and</p>
