                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1__para-i-2">
                    <num>i</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the determination relates to financial assistance to a State under <ref href="#sec-15D">section 15D</ref>; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1__para-ii-2">
                    <num>ii</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the State is a party to a designated housing agreement;</p>
                    </content>
