          <hcontainer name="part" eId="schedule-1__part-2">
            <num>2</num>
            <heading>Transitional</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-2__item-1">
              <num>10</num>
              <heading>Transitional—section 14 of the Federal Financial Relations Act 2009</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Despite the repeal of <ref href="#sec-14">section 14</ref> of the <i>Federal Financial Relations Act 2009</i> by this Schedule, that Act continues to apply, in relation to financial assistance for a financial year ending before 1 July 2018, as if that repeal had not happened.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 25 October 2017</i></p>
                <p><i>Senate on 19 March 2018</i>]</p>
                <p>(248/17)</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
